{"seq":2,"slug":"context-window-budget","title":"上下文窗口预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/foundations/context-window-budget","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文窗口预算\">上下文窗口预算</h1><p>「我的模型有 100 万 token 窗口，所以容量不是问题」——这句话在 2026 年同时是对的和危险的。对，是因为 13 个主流前沿模型确实都已提供 1M 以上的窗口；危险，是因为窗口大小是上限，不是预算，而真正约束你的是预算：每段内容的 token 成本、注意力随长度膨胀的算力代价、以及质量随占用率下降的隐性税。本篇把窗口从一个数字变成一张可核算的预算表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预算思维的起点，是承认窗口里的每一段内容都在竞争同一份稀缺额度，而这份额度有三重代价：占位代价（挤掉别的内容）、算力代价（注意力计算变贵）、质量代价（占用越满，有效注意力越稀）。把这三重代价显式记账，就是上下文预算。</p>\n<p>下图把一份典型的智能体窗口拆成预算条目，每一条都该被单独审视「值不值这些 token」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  W[窗口总额度&lt;br/&gt;如 200K token] --&gt; F[固定开销]&#10;  W --&gt; V[可变内容]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[系统指令]&#10;  F --&gt; F2[工具定义&lt;br/&gt;常被低估]&#10;  V --&gt; V1[历史消息&lt;br/&gt;随轮次线性增长]&#10;  V --&gt; V2[检索片段&lt;br/&gt;选择策略决定]&#10;  V --&gt; V3[记忆条目&lt;br/&gt;卸载策略决定]&#10;  V --&gt; V4[草稿板状态]&#10;  V1 --&gt; R[剩余可用额度&lt;br/&gt;= 总额 − 已占用]&#10;  R --&gt; Q[有效注意力质量&lt;br/&gt;随占用率下降]\">flowchart TD\n  W[窗口总额度&lt;br/&gt;如 200K token] --&gt; F[固定开销]\n  W --&gt; V[可变内容]\n  F --&gt; F1[系统指令]\n  F --&gt; F2[工具定义&lt;br/&gt;常被低估]\n  V --&gt; V1[历史消息&lt;br/&gt;随轮次线性增长]\n  V --&gt; V2[检索片段&lt;br/&gt;选择策略决定]\n  V --&gt; V3[记忆条目&lt;br/&gt;卸载策略决定]\n  V --&gt; V4[草稿板状态]\n  V1 --&gt; R[剩余可用额度&lt;br/&gt;= 总额 − 已占用]\n  R --&gt; Q[有效注意力质量&lt;br/&gt;随占用率下降]</pre><p>不同前沿模型的窗口与「装满它」的成本差异极大，这直接决定你的预算松紧。下表为 2026 年 6 月的公开数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>上下文窗口</th>\n<th>装满 1M 输入成本</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Claude Opus 4.8</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n<td>1M 窗口标准单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Fable 5</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$10.00</td>\n<td>同档最贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.5</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$5.00</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-5.4</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$2.50</td>\n<td>超 272K 后整段 2x 输入/1.5x 输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini 3.1 Pro</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$4.00</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek V4 Flash</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>$0.14</td>\n<td>同档最便宜，与最贵差 71 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Llama 4 Scout</td>\n<td>10M</td>\n<td>自托管</td>\n<td>开源权重，最大窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来源：morphllm.com 与 benchlm.ai 的 2026 年对比（<a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/llm-context-window-comparison\">LLM Context Window Comparison 2026</a>）。GPT-5.4 的「超 272K 整段加价」是预算上的暗礁——它意味着多塞一点点越过阈值，会让整个会话的单价翻倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-不是字符-内容的真实计价\">token 不是字符：内容的真实计价</h2><p>预算的最小单位是 token，而不同内容的 token 密度差异很大，估错会让预算全盘失真。粗略经验：英文约 4 字符/token，中文约 1.5 字符/token，代码因符号密集而 token 更碎。一个被严重低估的条目是工具定义——一个把 2500 多个 API 端点平铺成工具的传统 MCP 服务，光工具 schema 就能吃掉约 117 万 token；而 Cloudflare 在 2026 年 2 月的 Code Mode 架构把它们收敛成两个工具，仅约 1000 token（来源：<a href=\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/context-engineering-agent-reliability-playbook-2026\">Context Engineering Agent Reliability Playbook 2026</a>）。这说明工具定义常常是预算里最大的隐形开销，而它属于「固定开销」、每一轮都在付费。</p>\n<p>工具定义的精简策略属于 <a href=\"../assembly/context-selection\">上下文选择</a> 的范畴；如何让历史消息不无限增长，则见 <a href=\"../assembly/context-compression\">上下文压缩</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注意力的算力代价-为什么长不只是慢\">注意力的算力代价：为什么长不只是慢</h2><p>标准自注意力的计算量随序列长度平方增长。若序列长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、隐藏维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，注意力的计算复杂度约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2 d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，KV 缓存的显存占用则随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长，约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\cdot n \\cdot L \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为层数，系数 2 对应 K 和 V）。这意味着把上下文从 50K 翻倍到 100K，注意力计算量约变为 4 倍，而显存约变为 2 倍。</p>\n<p>预算因此不只是「花多少钱」，还包括「跑多慢、占多少显存」。这也是为什么即便模型「装得下」，把窗口塞满在生产上往往不划算。注意力平方代价的缓解（稀疏化、分页）属于供给侧，见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity\">注意力复杂度</a>；KV 缓存的显存账见 <a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/foundations/memory-accounting\">KV 缓存的显存核算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量税-占用率与有效注意力\">质量税：占用率与有效注意力</h2><p>预算里最容易被忽略的是质量税。多项 2026 年评测显示，模型在窗口占用超过约 32K token 后正确率开始下滑，且呈现强烈的位置偏好——头尾内容被充分关注，中段近乎被忽略（即 lost in the middle）。换句话说，剩余额度并非「免费可用」：你用得越满，每一段内容分到的有效注意力越少。</p>\n<p>把这一点写进预算，意味着应当为「质量」预留余量，而不是把窗口塞到物理上限。位置偏好的成因与利用见 <a href=\"../assembly/context-ordering\">排序与位置效应</a>，质量退化的全貌见 <a href=\"../management/context-rot-poisoning\">上下文腐烂与污染</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可操作的预算公式\">一个可操作的预算公式</h2><p>把上面三重代价合成一个简单的决策准则：对每个候选内容片段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，估计它的边际效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与边际代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(c) &gt; \\lambda \\cdot \\text{cost}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时纳入窗口，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是随当前占用率上升而增大的稀缺乘子。占用率越高，门槛越严——这正是把「窗口越满越该挑剔」编码进了公式。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 常用检索相关性分数近似，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 用 token 数近似，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 用一条随占用率上升的简单曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>窗口大小是上限，预算才是约束；每段内容承担占位、算力、质量三重代价。</li>\n<li>2026 年 1M 窗口已普及，但装满成本在不同模型间差达 71 倍，且部分模型越过阈值会整段加价。</li>\n<li>工具定义是最常被低估的固定开销，可达百万 token 级，精简它收益巨大。</li>\n<li>注意力按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2 d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 增长、KV 缓存线性增长、质量在约 32K 后下滑——三者共同要求为质量预留余量，而非塞满。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>如何在预算内挑内容：<a href=\"../assembly/context-selection\">上下文选择</a></li>\n<li>放不下时怎么缩：<a href=\"../assembly/context-compression\">上下文压缩</a></li>\n<li>质量退化全貌：<a href=\"../management/context-rot-poisoning\">上下文腐烂与污染</a></li>\n<li>跨库：注意力平方代价的缓解 — <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity\">注意力复杂度</a></li>\n<li>跨库：KV 缓存显存核算 — <a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/foundations/memory-accounting\">显存核算</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"上下文窗口预算","id":"上下文窗口预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"token 不是字符：内容的真实计价","id":"token-不是字符-内容的真实计价"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力的算力代价：为什么长不只是慢","id":"注意力的算力代价-为什么长不只是慢"},{"level":2,"text":"质量税：占用率与有效注意力","id":"质量税-占用率与有效注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可操作的预算公式","id":"一个可操作的预算公式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何上下文工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/foundations/why-context-engineering"},"next":{"title":"上下文工程与提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-context-engineering/foundations/context-vs-prompt"}}